{"id":"tolkom","lemma":"толком","pos":"adv","rank":3255,"glosses":["plainly, clearly","seriously, earnestly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c1/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Никто толком не знает, что случилось.","en":"No one really knows what happened.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"}]},{"text":"Я тебя толком не знаю.","en":"I don't really know you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"I don't know"]]},{"text":"Мы ничего толком не знаем о смерти.","en":"We don't really know anything about death.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"nothing"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"about"},{"g":"death","l":"смерть"}]},{"text":"Насос толком не работал.","en":"The pump didn't work properly.","words":[{"g":"pump"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to work","l":"работать"}]},{"text":"Я вас толком не знаю.","en":"I don't really know you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"I don't know"]]}]}